   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Mage-Flow text to image Turbo: 4 Euler/simple steps at CFG 1. Mage's native model configuration supplies shift 6.0 with multiplier 1; keep it unchanged. The native conditioning node supplies both branches and the 128-channel latent. Start at 1024x1024; dimensions must be multiples of 16. Expects mage_flow_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors, mage_qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors (CLIP type mage), and mage_flow_vae_bf16.safetensors from Comfy-Org/Mage-Flow. When you change quantization, pick the matching quality, edit or Turbo file. See docs/MODELS.md for the named quality/Turbo T2I controls. The only FSDP first-use proof is Base T2I BF16, one step, with no LoRA; other flavors and quantized FSDP remain unmeasured. Other precision, multi-reference, LoRA-backed slab, and topology cases remain limited to their own records. The first render of a new model runs the identity gate, comparing the mesh with a stock single-GPU load before producing pixels. Allow a few minutes for proof renders. Later renders of the same combination skip the gate. This graph is derived from the family adapter and stock node definitions, without a committed reference render. Check filenames and shapes against your artifacts before running it."
   ],
   "title": "DGX Monarch | Mage-Flow text to image Turbo"
  },
